@base = http://127.0.0.1:8083

### Crear una solicitud individual: 201 y requestId
POST {{base}}/api/student/requests
Content-Type: application/json

< ./peticion-valida.json

### Omitir el motivo: 400 sin crear un registro
POST {{base}}/api/student/requests
Content-Type: application/json

< ./peticion-sin-motivo.json

### JSON mal formado: 400
POST {{base}}/api/student/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{"subjectId":
